            "latin": "Oderat ergo semper Esau Jacob pro benedictione qua benedixerat ei pater : dixitque in corde suo : Venient dies luctus patris mei, et occidam Jacob fratrem meum.",
            "english": "Esau therefore always hated Jacob for the blessing wherewith his father had blessed him: and he said in his heart: The days will come of the mourning of my father, and I will kill my brother Jacob."
          },
          {
            "number": 42,
            "latin": "Nuntiata sunt haec Rebeccae : quae mittens et vocans Jacob filium suum, dixit ad eum : Ecce Esau frater tuus minatur ut occidat te.",
            "english": "These things were told to Rebecca: and she sent and called Jacob her son, and said to him: Look Esau your brother threateneth to kill you."
          },
          {
            "number": 43,
            "latin": "Nunc ergo, fili mi, audi vocem meam, et consurgens fuge ad Laban fratrem meum in Haran :",
            "english": "Now therefore, my son, hear my voice: arise and flee to Laban my brother to Haran:"
          },
          {
            "number": 44,
            "latin": "habitabisque cum eo dies paucos, donec requiescat furor fratris tui,",
            "english": "And you shall dwell with him a few days, till the wrath of your brother be assuaged,"
          },
          {
            "number": 45,
            "latin": "et cesset indignatio ejus, obliviscaturque eorum quae fecisti in eum : postea mittam, et adducam te inde huc : cur utroque orbabor filio in uno die?",
            "english": "And his indignation cease, and he forget the things you have done to him: afterwards I will send, and bring you from thence hither. Why shall I be deprived of both my sons in one day?"
          },
          {
            "number": 46,
            "latin": "Dixitque Rebecca ad Isaac : Taedet me vitae meae propter filias Heth : si acceperit Jacob uxorem de stirpe hujus terrae, nolo vivere.",
            "english": "And Rebecca said to Isaac: I am weary of my life because of the daughters of Heth: if Jacob take a wife of the stock of this land, I choose not to live."
